sequenceDiagram
    actor Approver
    participant API as Invoice API
    participant DB as Database and outbox (proposed)
    participant Worker as Submission worker (proposed)
    participant PayEx as PayEx API (proposed)

    Approver->>API: Approve invoice
    API->>DB: Save decision, audit and outbox in one transaction
    DB-->>API: Transaction committed
    API-->>Approver: Approval recorded; submission pending

    Worker->>DB: Read pending outbox item
    DB-->>Worker: Return submission details
    Worker->>PayEx: Submit with stable idempotency key

    alt Successful submission
        PayEx-->>Worker: Success and provider reference
        Worker->>DB: Save reference and completed status
    else Definite rejection
        PayEx-->>Worker: Rejection response
        Worker->>DB: Record failure
    else Timeout or ambiguous response
        PayEx-->>Worker: Outcome unknown
        Worker->>DB: Record unknown outcome
        Note over Worker,PayEx: Do not blindly resubmit with a new key
        Note over Worker,PayEx: Retry with the same key if supported
        Note over Worker,PayEx: Otherwise reconcile before resubmission
    end

    Note over API,PayEx: PROPOSED DESIGN - NOT IMPLEMENTED
